{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼傳聞中的PS6掌機可能成為唯一採用專用半定製RDNA 5晶片的便攜遊戲設備。業內據稱曾討論該掌機在RDNA 5方面擁有「某種獨佔」，但相關説法尚未得到官方確認。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583920.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:00.757404+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:08:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.869616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.869616+00:00","content_hash":"91885a8da9e662a2cd52081f3b32675c6f75dcd142097191f4e6be52401175f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}